--   - `MIPStarRE.QPBT.encodingPoly`: encodes a multilinear polynomial as a bounded polynomial representative.
--   - `MIPStarRE.QPBT.IsEncoding`: states when a polynomial outcome is an encoding because decoding recovers its underlying representative.
